    "Dollar values use mainnet market prices. Testnet assets have no value." : {
      "comment" : "Stellar Portfolio, in the hero card on Stellar's test network: the dollar figures value test XLM and USDC at the real (mainnet) market's prices, though test assets are worth nothing",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los valores en dólares usan precios de mercado de mainnet. Los activos de testnet no tienen valor."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les valeurs en dollars utilisent les prix du marché du mainnet. Les actifs du testnet n'ont aucune valeur."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "달러 가치는 메인넷 시장 가격을 사용해요. 테스트넷 자산은 가치가 없어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "美元价值采用主网市场价格。测试网资产没有价值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moment #%lld" : {
